aims-os-centre-senegal-labo (2.1+27) trixie; urgency=medium

  * SSH: accept passwords as well as the IT key, for the IT team only.
    Logins are gated on AllowGroups: the local aimsit account through the
    new system group aims-ssh, the IT staff through the directory group
    admins, which HBAC rule admins-partout already allows. Three attempts
    per connection, 30 second grace, and the firewall rule becomes
    "ufw limit" so repeated attempts from one address are dropped.
  * packettracer-fix: write the licence acceptance in /etc/skel, copied by
    pam_mkhomedir into every new home, and in the homes that already exist,
    so no account ever meets the prompt.

